@startuml

autonumber

actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend
database PostgreSQL

User -> Frontend: Ввод email/password
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/personal/login

Backend -> PostgreSQL: findByEmail(email)

alt User not found
    Backend --> Frontend: 404 user_not_found
else Email not confirmed
    Backend --> Frontend: 409 email_not_confirmed
else Invalid password
    Backend --> Frontend: 401 invalid_credentials
else Success
    Backend -> Backend: generate JWT
    Backend --> Frontend: 200 LoginResponse
end

@enduml